flowchart TD
    A[Read frozen input, capacities, budget and tolerances] --> B[Find one feasible whole-line plan per line; retain reliable local economic bounds]
    B --> C{Local feasibility status?}
    C -->|Proven empty domain| INF[Return proven infeasible]
    C -->|No plan and no proof| STOP[Return actual unresolved state, verified LB and valid UB]
    C -->|Every line has a plan| I[Elastic Phase I: real column profits = 0; hard convexity; elastic H/R capacities]
    I --> J{Artificial sum zero?}
    J -->|No| K[Price every line under the same Phase I duals]
    K --> L{All pricing maxima proven?}
    L -->|No| STOP
    L -->|Yes| M{Repaired Phase I UB strictly negative?}
    M -->|Yes| INF
    M -->|No, improving columns| I
    M -->|Numerically unresolved| STOP
    J -->|Yes| N[Resolve hard Phase II RMP; verify primal and dual]
    N -->|Unreliable status| STOP
    N --> O[Recover restricted integer plan; validate original constraints; update LB]
    O --> P{Verified LB closes a valid UB?}
    P -->|Yes| OPT[Return integer optimum within stated tolerances]
    P -->|No| Q[Exact pricing on every line using the same Phase II duals]
    Q --> R{All pricing maxima proven?}
    R -->|Yes| S[Repair full-column LP UB; add legal positive-reduced-cost columns]
    S --> T{Any new improving column?}
    T -->|Yes, time remains| N
    T -->|No| U[Build lower and upper resource-profile DP tables]
    R -->|No: preserve prior valid bounds| U
    U --> V{Integer bounds close?}
    V -->|Yes| OPT
    V -->|All integer combinations proven impossible| INF
    V -->|No| W{Budget remains?}
    W -->|No| STOP
    W -->|Yes| X[Query least-attempted unresolved profile on an upper-DP path]
    X --> Y[Fix exact resource counts; solve local profit MILP; record incumbent, valid UB or proven infeasibility]
    Y --> Z[Validate candidate plan; update both DP tables and actual integer bounds]
    Z --> U
